.*/
# The dot-directories are ignored, except the GitHub workflows and Dependabot config, the Kotlin/JS yarn lock, and
# impeccable's shared config (.impeccable/config.json, which keeps its design hook off the built docs site)
!.github/
!.kotlin-js-store/
!.impeccable/
# impeccable's per-machine state: one developer's hook consent, an editing session's journal, and the hook's scratch
.impeccable/config.local.json
.impeccable/live/sessions/
.impeccable/hook.cache.json
.impeccable/hook.pending.json
build/
out/
*.imp
*.ipr
*.iws
*.iml
*.idea

logs/
secrets/
.env

# The docs site: its build output is not kept, but website/uv.lock is, so the Website workflow builds with the Zensical
# it pins, even for someone whose global gitignore drops *.lock
website/history-walk/site/
!website/uv.lock

# The client's npm packages, pinned so CI builds what a release ships (build.gradle.kts), kept for the same reason
!.kotlin-js-store/yarn.lock
